      "statement": "Status meanings are fixed: truth = accepted axiom/root needing no derivation, unverified_truth = problem given believed but unchecked, derived = produced by a transformation with a derivation reference, target = what we are asked to find, unknown = explicitly impossible to determine, first-class and not an error.",
      "evidence": [
